AUDIO: 'and me in a way that\'s interesting? Maybe I can slowly reveal the background. And this is something that I want you to keep thinking about as you\'re out using it. It\'s not just a basic selfie stick. It\'s actually one of the most creative tools you can use'

[08:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
