AUDIO: 'to simply walk up behind us holding the stick. Another thing that I like to do is that you can simply hold the camera above you. And again, because of the flow state stabilization, if you just walk in a straight line, just recording'

[09:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'with the camera above your head, you then instantly get a hyperlapse ready video clip that you can speed up and have this awesome hyperlapse style camera movement that took zero effort to'

[09:18] [scene:talk]
