AUDIO: 'create. Not protecting the lens. It\'s just one of the realities of using these cameras. The lenses stick out when you place it down, when you put it places, it\'s the first thing that\'s going to'

[09:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'come in contact with the ground. And so it\'s not okay to simply just put it in your bag without a cover on. It\'s not okay to wipe it off with your t-shirt. You want to protect these lenses like the shot depends on it. And this actually has a lot of layers that I'

[09:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'think about while I\'m filming. So if you\'ve spent your day filming with this camera and you\'re snowboarding or you\'re on a jet ski and you\'re in an environment where there\'s particles, you\'re going to want to be cleaning the lens midactivity. That\'s just a reality'

[09:55] [scene:demo]
